From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Strata-2080Ti stack <stack@noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:36:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] SONNET-STRATA-Porta da upstream #3104
 STRATA_PF_FUSED_NATIVE_SM75: esperti fusi int8 IQ del prefill anche su Turing
 (opt-in)

Estende i kernel nativi IQ (gate/up IQ2_XXS, IQ2_XS, IQ2_S, IQ3_XXS, IQ3_S, IQ4_XS; down Q2_0 e IQ4_NL)
a sm_75 con la forma da 128 righe, dietro STRATA_PF_FUSED=1 STRATA_PF_FUSED_SM75=1
STRATA_PF_FUSED_NATIVE_SM75=1. Le coppie non coperte restano su MMQ. Applicato pulito su 0.1.45
(sostituisce #3085, stessa funzione con un altro gate). Cambia i bit del prefill (nb).
Compilato no, installato no, provato no.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/docs/DETAILS.md b/docs/DETAILS.md
index d6d9e33c..7b8ee1bd 100644
--- a/docs/DETAILS.md
+++ b/docs/DETAILS.md
@@ -28,6 +28,12 @@ argmax run on thread-block clusters (RTX 50, sm_90+; other cards keep the previo
 IQ3 packs about even; on HIP they run on gfx11 and on gfx1200 / gfx1201, see AMD_HIP.md); `STRATA_QSA_CLUSTER=0` / `STRATA_ARGMAX_MULTI=0` turn the decode kernels off. The tables
 below are 0.1.26's.
 
+On an sm_75 GPU, `STRATA_PF_FUSED=1 STRATA_PF_FUSED_SM75=1 STRATA_PF_FUSED_NATIVE_SM75=1` extends the existing native-IQ
+path to covered IQ expert pairs with the qualified 128-row work shape. The first two variables are the existing fused
+prefill gates; `STRATA_PF_FUSED_NATIVE_SM75` is the new, separate A/B gate for this Turing extension. The upstream
+SM80+ native-IQ path is unchanged. Unsupported layers keep MMQ. The setting is manual and affects sm_75 prompt
+experts only.
+
 ### Prompt processing (tokens/s)
 
 | Model | 1K | 4K | 32K | 64K | 128K | 262K |
